

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Catch the Ball</title>

<style>
body {
    background: #101827;
    color: white;
    font-family: Arial;
    text-align: center;
}

h1 {
    color: #00e5ff;
}

.game {
    width: 350px;
    height: 450px;
    margin: 30px auto;
    background: #243b55;
    border: 3px solid white;
    border-radius: 15px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.ball {
    position: absolute;
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.ball input {
    display: none;
}

.ball span {
    display: block;
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.ball input:checked + span {
    display: none;
}

.one {
    left: 40px;
    animation: fall 5s linear infinite;
}

.two {
    left: 150px;
    animation: fall 4s linear infinite;
    animation-delay: 1s;
}

.three {
    left: 260px;
    animation: fall 6s linear infinite;
    animation-delay: 2s;
}

.one span { background: #ff4757; }
.two span { background: #ffd700; }
.three span { background: #2ed573; }

@keyframes fall {
    from { top: -50px; }
    to { top: 450px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<h1>🎮 CATCH THE BALL</h1>
<p>Нажми на шарик, чтобы поймать его!</p>

<div class="game">

<label class="ball one">
<input type="checkbox">
<span></span>
</label>

<label class="ball two">
<input type="checkbox">
<span></span>
</label>

<label class="ball three">
<input type="checkbox">
<span></span>
</label>

</div>

</body>
</html>
